title: A World Is Freed
subtitle: The Republic retakes lost ground.
tags: event
view-if: world_lib_ready = 1 and war and not game_ending
priority: 6
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_war.svg
on-arrival: {! SW.worldLiberated(Q); !}

= [+ world_lib_name +] Is Free

Republic forces advancing on [+ world_lib_front_name +] have liberated [+ world_lib_name +]. Its people line the streets for the troops, and its senators fly home to a hero's welcome.
